WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.698
[BLOWING]

00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:11.310
Come on,
come on, come on.

00:00:13.529 --> 00:00:16.010
It does what
you tell it?

00:00:16.053 --> 00:00:18.491
Yeah. Sort of.

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.014
The sun?

00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:22.495
No, no, no. Fire.

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:26.063
Hi, fire.

00:00:26.107 --> 00:00:27.195
[CHUCKLES]

00:00:28.892 --> 00:00:30.981
It's not alive.

00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:32.896
But you said it was dying.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.203
Sorry.

00:00:35.247 --> 00:00:37.510
Uh...
It comes from
where you come from?

00:00:37.553 --> 00:00:39.860
No. No, I make it.

00:00:39.903 --> 00:00:41.296
Make some for me.
Ow! Okay.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.471
Make!

00:00:42.515 --> 00:00:43.690
It doesn't
come out of me.

00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:45.561
Make! Make it!
[CHOKING]

00:00:45.605 --> 00:00:47.084
[BONES CRACKING]

00:00:47.128 --> 00:00:49.565
[RASPING]
You do this a lot.

00:00:51.393 --> 00:00:53.352
Are you dead?

00:00:53.395 --> 00:00:55.441
Can I have your fire
if you're dead?

00:00:56.268 --> 00:00:57.443
[CHITTERING]

00:00:59.706 --> 00:01:01.229
Clear!

00:01:01.273 --> 00:01:03.013
Hey, those are cold!
[CHITTERING]

00:01:03.057 --> 00:01:05.581
You think?
Listening shells,
activate.

00:01:06.582 --> 00:01:07.888
I concur.

00:01:07.931 --> 00:01:10.412
Tiger girl, we need
to leave immediately.

00:01:10.456 --> 00:01:12.414
I don't even know you.

00:01:12.893 --> 00:01:14.024
Mmm.

00:01:14.068 --> 00:01:15.200
I'm Guy.

00:01:15.243 --> 00:01:16.723
Guy?

00:01:16.766 --> 00:01:18.986
And this is Belt. Cook,
conversationalist, navigator.

00:01:19.029 --> 00:01:21.771
[CHITTERING]
Also, keeps my pants up.

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:23.425
What are "pants up"?

00:01:23.469 --> 00:01:24.905
Who are you?

00:01:24.948 --> 00:01:26.559
Oh... Eep.

00:01:26.602 --> 00:01:28.735
Let me clarify, Eep.
The world is ending.

00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:29.910
What?

00:01:29.953 --> 00:01:32.260
I'm calling it "The End."

00:01:32.304 --> 00:01:34.349
Dun-dun-dun!

00:01:35.437 --> 00:01:36.873
How do you know?

00:01:36.917 --> 00:01:38.397
I have seen it.
It's coming this way.

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:39.833
First, the ground
is going to shake.

00:01:39.876 --> 00:01:42.096
Then it breaks open.
Everything falls in.

00:01:42.139 --> 00:01:43.402
Fire. Lava.

00:01:43.445 --> 00:01:44.707
I don't mean to
sound too dramatic, but--

00:01:44.751 --> 00:01:45.752
[SCREAMING]

00:01:47.362 --> 00:01:51.148
Believe me, everything
we are standing on
will be gone.

00:01:51.192 --> 00:01:52.280
We got to get
to high ground.

00:01:52.324 --> 00:01:53.412
I know a mountain,
that way.

00:01:53.455 --> 00:01:55.152
It's our only chance.

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:57.242
Come with me.

00:01:57.285 --> 00:01:58.373
[CHITTERING]

00:01:59.331 --> 00:02:01.637
I can't.

00:02:02.116 --> 00:02:03.160
Okay.

00:02:05.162 --> 00:02:06.294
Here.

00:02:06.338 --> 00:02:08.253
[PLAYS LOW NOTE]

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:13.301
If you survive,
uh, call me.

00:02:14.346 --> 00:02:15.477
[GASPS]

00:02:16.826 --> 00:02:18.611
[PLAYS LOW NOTE]
[LAUGHING]

00:02:18.654 --> 00:02:20.047
Thank you.

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:22.179
Hello?

00:02:22.789 --> 00:02:24.007
Hey!

00:02:26.053 --> 00:02:27.184
[GASPS] Dad!

00:02:27.228 --> 00:02:28.969
Are you hurt?
What took you?

00:02:29.012 --> 00:02:31.754
Nothing.
I left on my own.

00:02:31.798 --> 00:02:33.974
You what?

00:02:34.017 --> 00:02:36.150
Dad, let me explain.

00:02:36.193 --> 00:02:37.412
[ANIMAL ROARS]

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:41.590
[SNIFFING]

00:02:43.462 --> 00:02:45.202
[WHISPERS] You
never let me talk.

00:02:45.246 --> 00:02:47.074
You're grounded.
[GROANS]

00:02:50.382 --> 00:02:51.861
[GRUNTS]
Hey!

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:54.995
[GASPS] Eep!

00:02:55.038 --> 00:02:56.518
Mom.

00:02:56.562 --> 00:02:58.303
Grug!
What happened?

00:02:58.346 --> 00:03:00.783
You know what,
I am so mad right now
that I can't talk to her.

00:03:00.827 --> 00:03:02.568
[SNIFFS]
Eep?

00:03:02.611 --> 00:03:05.658
You will never believe it.
I found something new.

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:06.833
BOTH: New!

00:03:06.876 --> 00:03:08.182
New is
a big problem!

00:03:08.225 --> 00:03:09.401
EEP: Wait, wait!
[GROWLS]

00:03:09.444 --> 00:03:11.185
Eep. Stay inside
the family kill circle.

00:03:11.228 --> 00:03:13.318
It wasn't bad.
"New" is always bad.

00:03:13.361 --> 00:03:14.841
No. He was nice.

00:03:14.884 --> 00:03:16.973
What?
Excuse me? He?

00:03:17.017 --> 00:03:21.151
I thought he was
a warthog, but then
he turned into a boy.

00:03:21.195 --> 00:03:22.327
GRAN: Strange.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.372
Usually it's the reverse.

00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:26.766
Eep's got a boy hog.
Eep's got a boy--

00:03:26.809 --> 00:03:28.463
[GROANS]
There was a boy.

00:03:28.507 --> 00:03:30.422
Watch.
I'm going to call him.

00:03:30.465 --> 00:03:31.466
[ALL GASP]

00:03:34.513 --> 00:03:36.079
[PLAYS LOW NOTE]Ah!

00:03:36.123 --> 00:03:37.385
[ALL YELLING]

00:03:37.429 --> 00:03:38.821
[SHELL SHATTERING]

00:03:44.436 --> 00:03:45.437
[SIGHS]

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:49.528
What is wrong with you?

00:03:49.571 --> 00:03:50.703
It was dangerous.

00:03:50.746 --> 00:03:52.792
It was beautiful!

00:03:52.835 --> 00:03:55.185
You want to see
dangerous? Here!

00:03:55.229 --> 00:03:56.404
[GROANS]
Ow!

00:03:56.448 --> 00:03:57.536
My sniffer!

00:03:57.579 --> 00:03:58.711
Okay, that's it!

00:03:58.754 --> 00:04:00.408
We're going
back to the cave...

00:04:00.452 --> 00:04:02.889
and you're going
to stay in there until
you're older than...

00:04:02.932 --> 00:04:03.977
uh...

00:04:04.369 --> 00:04:05.457
her!

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.328
What!

00:04:07.372 --> 00:04:10.244
You can't keep me
inside forever!

00:04:10.287 --> 00:04:11.288
[GRUNTS]

00:04:13.769 --> 00:04:14.901
[GASPS]

00:04:16.555 --> 00:04:17.556
[GASPS]

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:19.819
[RUMBLING]

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.170
He said this would happen.

00:04:23.213 --> 00:04:24.301
[GASPS]

00:04:24.345 --> 00:04:25.520
[GROUND CREAKING]

00:04:29.219 --> 00:04:30.786
Get to the cave!

00:04:32.571 --> 00:04:33.615
Go!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:39.621
[ALL GRUNT]

00:04:48.064 --> 00:04:49.065
Ah!

00:04:51.067 --> 00:04:52.155
[PANTING]

00:04:57.422 --> 00:04:58.423
[GASPS]

00:05:04.429 --> 00:05:05.734
Look out!

00:05:06.996 --> 00:05:07.997
Stop!

00:05:15.091 --> 00:05:16.310
[ALL YELPING]

00:05:38.637 --> 00:05:39.855
[ALL COUGHING]

00:05:47.515 --> 00:05:48.995
Is everyone okay?

00:05:49.038 --> 00:05:50.736
UGGA: Yes.

00:05:50.779 --> 00:05:54.000
Grug, the cave...

00:05:54.043 --> 00:05:55.697
it's gone.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.222
No.

00:06:17.327 --> 00:06:18.459
[SIGHS]

00:06:33.518 --> 00:06:34.954
[GASPS]

00:06:34.997 --> 00:06:38.348
You really
need to see this.

